<title>FRANCE: Gle des Eaux H1 net attrib 808 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Gle des Eaux H1 net attrib 808 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   808    vs	  224</p>
<p>    Operating				    1.4    up	 7.4 pct</p>
<p>    Financial costs			    1.3    vs	  1.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional gain			   1.7    vs	  n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover				    79.2    vs	  n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Compagnie Generale des Eaux gave its results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
